    <string name="status_bar_clock_custom_tips">Date\ny — year. yy: 23, yyyy: 2023.\nM — month (1–12). MM: 01–12.\nMMM — abbreviated month (Jan). MMMM — full month name (January).\nd — day of the month (1–31). D — day of the year (1–366).\nE — abbreviated weekday (Tue). EEEE — full weekday name (Tuesday).\nF — occurrence of the weekday in the month (for example, the second Tuesday).\nw — week of the year (1–53). W — week of the month.\n\nTime\nh — hour (1–12). H — hour (0–23).\nK — hour (0–11). k — hour (1–24).\nm — minutes (0–59). s — seconds (0–59). S — milliseconds (0–999).\na — AM or PM.\n\nTime zone\nz — abbreviated name (PST). zzzz — full name (Pacific Standard Time).\nZ — RFC 822 offset (−0800).\nX, XX, XXX — ISO 8601 offset (−08, −0800, −08:00).</string>
